<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>風象星座 on Lucky Stone</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/tags/%E9%A2%A8%E8%B1%A1%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7/</link><description>Recent content in 風象星座 on Lucky Stone</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Sat, 30 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://luckystonetw.com/tags/%E9%A2%A8%E8%B1%A1%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>雙子座性格全解析：風象變動宮的好奇雙面與心智宇宙</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E9%9B%99%E5%AD%90%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E9%A2%A8%E8%B1%A1%E8%AE%8A%E5%8B%95%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%A5%BD%E5%A5%87%E9%9B%99%E9%9D%A2%E8%88%87%E5%BF%83%E6%99%BA%E5%AE%87%E5%AE%99/</link><pubDate>Sat, 30 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E9%9B%99%E5%AD%90%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E9%A2%A8%E8%B1%A1%E8%AE%8A%E5%8B%95%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%A5%BD%E5%A5%87%E9%9B%99%E9%9D%A2%E8%88%87%E5%BF%83%E6%99%BA%E5%AE%87%E5%AE%99/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;雙子座的符號是&lt;strong&gt;雙生子&lt;/strong&gt;——兩個一模一樣卻面向不同方向的人。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>水瓶座性格全解析：風象固定宮的創新前衛與人道精神</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%B0%B4%E7%93%B6%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E9%A2%A8%E8%B1%A1%E5%9B%BA%E5%AE%9A%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%89%B5%E6%96%B0%E5%89%8D%E8%A1%9B%E8%88%87%E4%BA%BA%E9%81%93%E7%B2%BE%E7%A5%9E/</link><pubDate>Sun, 17 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%B0%B4%E7%93%B6%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E9%A2%A8%E8%B1%A1%E5%9B%BA%E5%AE%9A%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%89%B5%E6%96%B0%E5%89%8D%E8%A1%9B%E8%88%87%E4%BA%BA%E9%81%93%E7%B2%BE%E7%A5%9E/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;水瓶座的中文名字常讓人誤會——以為「&lt;strong&gt;水瓶&lt;/strong&gt;」是水象星座。其實不是，水瓶座是&lt;strong&gt;風象星座&lt;/strong&gt;，符號的水瓶倒出的也不是水，是**「知識之水」**。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>天秤座性格全解析：風象開創宮的平衡美學與夥伴關係</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%A4%A9%E7%A7%A4%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E9%A2%A8%E8%B1%A1%E9%96%8B%E5%89%B5%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%B9%B3%E8%A1%A1%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%B8%E8%88%87%E5%A4%A5%E4%BC%B4%E9%97%9C%E4%BF%82/</link><pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%A4%A9%E7%A7%A4%E5%BA%A7%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E5%85%A8%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E9%A2%A8%E8%B1%A1%E9%96%8B%E5%89%B5%E5%AE%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%B9%B3%E8%A1%A1%E7%BE%8E%E5%AD%B8%E8%88%87%E5%A4%A5%E4%BC%B4%E9%97%9C%E4%BF%82/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;天秤座是十二星座裡唯一&lt;strong&gt;以「物品」為符號&lt;/strong&gt;的星座——不是動物、不是人，而是一個&lt;strong&gt;天秤&lt;/strong&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>風象星座能量解析：雙子天秤水瓶的風之性格與守護水晶</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E9%A2%A8%E8%B1%A1%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E9%9B%99%E5%AD%90%E5%A4%A9%E7%A7%A4%E6%B0%B4%E7%93%B6%E7%9A%84%E9%A2%A8%E4%B9%8B%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E8%88%87%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6/</link><pubDate>Thu, 23 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E9%A2%A8%E8%B1%A1%E6%98%9F%E5%BA%A7%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E9%9B%99%E5%AD%90%E5%A4%A9%E7%A7%A4%E6%B0%B4%E7%93%B6%E7%9A%84%E9%A2%A8%E4%B9%8B%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC%E8%88%87%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;風有很多種吹拂的方式——有的是春天的穿堂風，在每扇窗之間穿梭，帶來各個房間的消息；有的是傍晚的微風，溫柔地拂過水面，讓一切歸於和諧的漣漪；有的是高空的氣流，看不見摸不著，卻悄悄改變了整片天空的走向。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>